OL,3,GNEWSANew church leader ready for
OL,4,A'fusion of roles'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new Dean of Guernsey has told how
OL,7,Fhe worked as a bank manager before
OL,8,Fgetting a calling to the church and his
OL,9,Fnew role in the Channel Islands.
OL,11,FThe Venerable Matthew Trick was
OL,12,Finstalled as the new leader of the
OL,13,FChurch of England in Guernsey on
OL,14,FTuesday. His role also includes
OL,15,Fbecoming Vicar of Sark.
OL,17,FHe takes over from the Very Reverend
OL,18,FTim Barker who had been the Dean since
OL,19,F2015 but retired earlier this year.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
