OL,3,GNEWSANew church leader ready for
OL,4,A'fusion of roles'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrick told BBC Guernsey his new role
OL,7,Fwas a unique combination of duties: "It
OL,8,Fis one of those really curious roles,
OL,9,Fclearly there is an ecclesiastical
OL,10,Frole... but it's also a civic and
OL,11,Fcommunity role and an interesting
OL,12,Ffusion."
